 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3">WOWOHCOOL vs Industrie: Les Chiffres</h3>
 <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
 <table class="w-full text-sm rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
